	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p>You have experience in close-quarters unarmed brawls, and know how to deal heavy blows with just about anything.</p><ul><li><p>You can attempt to &amp;reference[grappled]{grapple} a creature with an &amp;reference[opportunityattacks]{opportunity attack} if you have at least one hand is empty.</p></li><li><p>You can deal &amp;reference[bludgeoning] damage with any melee weapon.</p></li><li><p>You have proficiency with @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.pRDNsHpNLLk1Qq58]{unarmed strikes} and improvised weapons. Your unarmed strikes and improvised weapons deal [[/r 1d6]] damage if not already higher.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Note: Use your Unarmed Strike item for unarmed attacks and this feature to make improvised weapon attacks.</strong></p>",
			"chat": ""
		},
